# Runtime requirements from the pinned DiffusionDriveV2 source:
# https://github.com/hustvl/DiffusionDriveV2/blob/1cd12a1e155c34dcc471261835444c8d5587580b/requirements.txt
#
# The upstream Git dependency is expressed as the immutable nuPlan archive so
# uv can hash it. Upstream docs/install.md names diffusers and einops without
# versions; these exact pins make that additional runtime contract reproducible.
# diffusers 0.35.2 is the newest tested release that imports with the upstream
# torch 2.0.1 pin; 0.36.0 accesses torch.xpu, which torch 2.0.1 does not expose.

